WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Material transitions happen at real interfaces: seams, joints, seals and trim boundaries. Their placement affects assembly and visual continuity.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Follow one panel edge around a corner; note where the gap, seal and adjacent part must meet.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Interface annotation

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

